        "theme":  "Models",
        "summary":  "Anthropic launched Claude Fable 5.1 and Claude Mythos 5.1, positioning them as the world\u0027s most advanced models for coding and knowledge work. Fable 5.1 is priced approximately 25% lower than its predecessor through reduced cache read costs. The models show notable gains in scientific capabilities, including protein binder design and computational biology.",
        "execSummary":  "Anthropic has released two new frontier models — Fable 5.1 and Mythos 5.1 — targeting enterprise coding and knowledge work at meaningfully lower cost than prior generations. The 25% reduction in cache read pricing is a direct lever for enterprises running high-volume workloads, improving the economics of production AI deployments. Scientific benchmark gains signal that these models are increasingly viable for R\u0026D and regulated-sector applications beyond standard business automation. Enterprise buyers evaluating model contracts should reassess cost projections and benchmark fit against these new capability tiers.",
