        "summary":  "This guide walks developers through a three-stage migration path from self-hosted LangGraph agents to Amazon Bedrock AgentCore, progressively offloading OS patching, tool authorization, and conversation state management to AWS managed services. Each stage preserves agent behavior while reducing operational overhead, culminating in model-driven planning via the Strands SDK.",
