        "theme":  "Enterprise",
        "summary":  "AI-assisted modernization is reducing the time and complexity of transforming legacy systems while creating foundations for faster future innovation. Bupa\u0027s migration of its My Bupa mobile app from Xamarin to native Swift and Kotlin demonstrates how treating legacy modernization as business transformation rather than a technical rewrite can dramatically improve customer outcomes and enable future AI-driven capabilities.",
        "execSummary":  "Bupa\u0027s mobile platform modernization shows that legacy migration succeeds when framed as customer experience transformation — not a technology project — and that AI tools are now materially reducing the cost and timeline of that migration work. For customer support leaders, the strategic signal is that AI-powered legacy modernization has crossed a practicality threshold: organizations still running outdated customer-facing platforms can now modernize faster and at lower risk than a few years ago. The caveat is that Bupa\u0027s success relied on treating the project as business transformation with executive sponsorship, not an IT initiative. Leaders should use this framing when building the business case for long-deferred modernization programs.",
